    {
      "start": 722.23,
      "end": 725.23,
      "text": "Is she changing the movie to, uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": 725.23,
      "end": 728.23,
      "text": "I feel very level long."
    },
    {
      "start": 728.23,
      "end": 730.23,
      "text": "I don't know what's going to be happening now."
    },
    {
      "start": 730.23,
      "end": 732.23,
      "text": "What do you say, guys?"
    },
    {
      "start": 732.23,
      "end": 736.23,
      "text": "I end up in sin. This is why it was the greatest film of the millennia."
    },
    {
      "start": 736.23,
      "end": 738.23,
      "text": "You bet, Dangerous."
    },
    {
      "start": 738.23,
      "end": 741.23,
      "text": "Well, we didn't even know it came out, because it was a game."
    },
    {
      "start": 741.23,
      "end": 743.23,
      "text": "What could possibly go wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 743.23,
      "end": 745.23,
      "text": "Sorry, buddy. I can't."
    },
    {
      "start": 745.23,
      "end": 748.23,
      "text": "I've got, uh... something else."
    },
    {
      "start": 748.23,
      "end": 750.23,
      "text": "Is it a Hideo Kojima movie?"
    },
    {
      "start": 750.23,
      "end": 752.23,
      "text": "I have to keep my eye on today. You guys go out without me."
    },
    {
      "start": 752.23,
      "end": 753.23,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 753.23,
      "end": 759.23,
      "text": "Hideo Kojima in collaboration with Quentin Tarantino, Stephen Spielberg, Stephen King."
    },
    {
      "start": 759.23,
      "end": 763.23,
      "text": "All of them were involved in Dangerous 3."
    },
    {
      "start": 763.23,
      "end": 765.23,
      "text": "He can't stop believing."
    },
    {
      "start": 765.23,
      "end": 771.23,
      "text": "The moody lighting and smoky atmosphere are being brightened too much by this plant."
    },
    {
      "start": 771.23,
      "end": 774.23,
      "text": "Maybe I should take it out for some fresh air and water."
    },
    {
      "start": 774.23,
      "end": 777.23,
      "text": "Okay, he is looking a little pale in here."
    },
    {
      "start": 777.23,
      "end": 779.23,
      "text": "Perhaps some sunlight would do him good."
    },
    {
      "start": 779.23,
      "end": 781.23,
      "text": "Now we have him as an item."
    },
    {
      "start": 781.23,
      "end": 784.99,
      "text": "We didn't rank up for it, though."
    },
    {
      "start": 784.99,
      "end": 788.99,
      "text": "The treacherous jungles of Strong Borneo."
    },
    {
      "start": 788.99,
      "end": 789.99,
      "text": "Strong Borneo."
    },
    {
      "start": 794.99,
      "end": 795.99,
      "text": "Oh, okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 795.99,
      "end": 804.52,
      "text": "Whoa."
    },
    {
      "start": 804.52,
      "end": 805.52,
      "text": "Whoa."
    },
    {
      "start": 805.52,
      "end": 807.52,
      "text": "This light metal gets all lit fire."
    },
    {
      "start": 807.52,
      "end": 809.52,
      "text": "Got it."
    },
    {
      "start": 812.52,
      "end": 814.52,
      "text": "These are all Marzipan's plants."
    },
    {
      "start": 815.52,
      "end": 818.52,
      "text": "Yeah, these are all Marzipan's plants, aren't they?"
    },
    {
      "start": 819.52,
      "end": 821.52,
      "text": "They're in the rain first."
    },
    {
      "start": 826.52,
      "end": 827.52,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "start": 828.52,
      "end": 829.52,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 843.52,
      "end": 844.52,
      "text": "True."
    },
    {
      "start": 844.52,
      "end": 846.52,
      "text": "Well, we aren't at the boat yet."
    },
    {
      "start": 847.52,
      "end": 849.52,
      "text": "Now we are out of the boat."
    },
    {
      "start": 850.52,
      "end": 855.52,
      "text": "Okay, according to this map, the formula should be around here somewhere."
    },
    {
      "start": 855.52,
      "end": 856.52,
      "text": "This movie pops."
    },
    {
      "start": 856.52,
      "end": 857.52,
      "text": "Look around, Rinaldo."
    },
    {
      "start": 857.52,
      "end": 858.52,
      "text": "Best movie ever."
    },
    {
      "start": 858.52,
      "end": 859.52,
      "text": "Don't touch anything."
    },
    {
      "start": 860.52,
      "end": 863.52,
      "text": "Don't touch anything, but I want to touch everything."
    },
    {
      "start": 863.52,
      "end": 864.52,
      "text": "Uh, the signs."
    },
    {
      "start": 864.52,
      "end": 867.52,
      "text": "Clearly, this is meant to scare people off."
    },
    {
      "start": 867.52,
      "end": 871.52,
      "text": "But for dangerous, it's just an invitation to get to..."
    },
    {
      "start": 871.52,
      "end": 872.52,
      "text": "Oh, the car is somewhere."
    },
    {
      "start": 872.52,
      "end": 877.3,
      "text": "...behind this sign."
    },
    {
      "start": 877.3,
      "end": 886.8,
      "text": "The jungles of Strong Borneo have many..."
    },
    {
      "start": 886.8,
      "end": 889.8,
      "text": "I think you should kill Kojizi with the Nunchuk Gun."
    },
    {
      "start": 889.8,
      "end": 893.66,
      "text": "Or Rinaldo, sorry."
    },
    {
      "start": 893.66,
      "end": 895.66,
      "text": "What area?"
    },
    {
      "start": 895.66,
      "end": 896.66,
      "text": "Quicksand!"
    },
    {
      "start": 896.66,
      "end": 899.66,
      "text": "This place is full of deadly pitfalls."
    },
    {
      "start": 899.66,
      "end": 901.66,
      "text": "Watch your step."
    },
    {
      "start": 901.66,
      "end": 903.66,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 903.66,
      "end": 906.1,
      "text": "Higher."
    },
    {
      "start": 906.1,
      "end": 921.06,
      "text": "I'd never get tired of that."
    },
    {
      "start": 921.06,
      "end": 922.06,
      "text": "Nope."
    },
    {
      "start": 922.06,
      "end": 925.3,
      "text": "Great kit."
    },
    {
      "start": 925.3,
      "end": 935.53,
      "text": "There's no reason to randomly put a plant here."
    },
    {
      "start": 935.53,
      "end": 936.53,
      "text": "Uh, okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 936.53,
      "end": 943.04,
      "text": "Not plants."
    },
    {
      "start": 943.04,
      "end": 946.04,
      "text": "Well, there's only so many things we can interact with here at least."
    },
    {
      "start": 946.04,
      "end": 950.04,
      "text": "No way this old Riverquest boat is gonna make it back up that waterfall."
    },
    {
      "start": 950.04,
      "end": 952.04,
      "text": "I better leave it here."
    },
    {
      "start": 952.04,
      "end": 954.04,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 954.04,
      "end": 961.99,
      "text": "A Diet Coke to Rinaldo?"
    },
    {
      "start": 961.99,
      "end": 962.99,
      "text": "He's not thirsty."
    },
    {
      "start": 962.99,
      "end": 963.99,
      "text": "Trust me."
    },
    {
      "start": 963.99,
      "end": 965.99,
      "text": "I'm detective-esque."
    },
    {
      "start": 965.99,
      "end": 966.99,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 966.99,
      "end": 968.99,
      "text": "Oh, the shooting stuff."
    },
    {
      "start": 970.99,
      "end": 980.46,
      "text": "Interrogating inanimate objects isn't as helpful as you might think."
    },
    {
      "start": 980.46,
      "end": 982.46,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 982.46,
      "end": 985.46,
      "text": "I thought it would make boxes appear like last time."
    },
    {
      "start": 989.12,
      "end": 992.12,
      "text": "We're starting to get already into dumb..."
    },
    {
      "start": 992.12,
      "end": 995.12,
      "text": "Did they just run out of ideas immediately?"
    },
    {
      "start": 995.12,
      "end": 997.12,
      "text": "What the fuck?"
    },
    {
      "start": 997.12,
      "end": 998.12,
      "text": "I don't know."
    },
    {
      "start": 998.12,
      "end": 999.12,
      "text": "We talked to Rinaldo."
    },
    {
      "start": 999.12,
      "end": 1001.12,
      "text": "Ernie loves finding that formula!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1001.12,
      "end": 1003.12,
      "text": "Not yet!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1003.12,
      "end": 1005.12,
      "text": "Ernie loves finding that..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1005.12,
      "end": 1007.12,
      "text": "Not yet!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1007.12,
      "end": 1008.12,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "start": 1008.12,
      "end": 1010.12,
      "text": "We've got a lot of info with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1010.12,
      "end": 1011.12,
      "text": "Let me check."
    },
    {
      "start": 1011.12,
      "end": 1013.12,
      "text": "Keep a look still."
    },
    {
      "start": 1013.12,
      "end": 1015.12,
      "text": "Yup, we have unlocked."
    },
    {
      "start": 1015.12,
      "end": 1016.12,
      "text": "Yup, yup."
    },
    {
      "start": 1016.12,
      "end": 1019.12,
      "text": "Shoot the stop sign with the nunchuck gun, apparently."
    },
    {
      "start": 1019.12,
      "end": 1021.12,
      "text": "I'll put it on my right check."
    },
    {
      "start": 1021.12,
      "end": 1023.12,
      "text": "You shot the plants."
    },
    {
      "start": 1023.12,
      "end": 1025.12,
      "text": "You shot the plants, not the stop sign."
    },
    {
      "start": 1025.12,
      "end": 1028.98,
      "text": "You read about that."
    },
    {
      "start": 1028.98,
      "end": 1030.98,
      "text": "Ah ha!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1030.98,
      "end": 1034.98,
      "text": "A secret area for stashing valuable items!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1034.98,
      "end": 1036.98,
      "text": "Let's say, for example..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1036.98,
      "end": 1037.98,
      "text": "Oh, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "start": 1037.98,
      "end": 1040.98,
      "text": "The rainforest formula!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1040.98,
      "end": 1042.98,
      "text": "They should get better hints."
    },
    {
      "start": 1042.98,
      "end": 1045.98,
      "text": "You've interacted with that stop sign and it didn't really tell you nothing."
    },
    {
      "start": 1045.98,
      "end": 1048.98,
      "text": "Quite...reach...and..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1048.98,
      "end": 1049.98,
      "text": "Let me try."
    },
    {
      "start": 1049.98,
      "end": 1052.98,
      "text": "My arms are longer and stickier."
    },
    {
      "start": 1052.98,
      "end": 1054.98,
      "text": "No wait, it's a trap!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1056.98,
      "end": 1060.86,
      "text": "Oh, shit."
    },
    {
      "start": 1060.86,
      "end": 1062.86,
      "text": "Look out, Rinaldo!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1062.86,
      "end": 1065.86,
      "text": "It's a western lowland grizzly shark forest bot!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1065.86,
      "end": 1067.86,
      "text": "And it's holding a shark!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1067.86,
      "end": 1072.39,
      "text": "No fun traps!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1072.39,
      "end": 1073.39,
      "text": "Shoot it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1073.39,
      "end": 1074.39,
      "text": "Kill."
    },
    {
      "start": 1074.39,
      "end": 1075.39,
      "text": "Kill."
    },
    {
      "start": 1075.39,
      "end": 1076.39,
      "text": "Kill."
    },
    {
      "start": 1076.39,
      "end": 1078.99,
      "text": "Fucking destroy it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1078.99,
      "end": 1079.99,
      "text": "Save Rinaldo."
    },
    {
      "start": 1079.99,
      "end": 1082.99,
      "text": "Good thing there are two sides to every gun!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1082.99,
      "end": 1086.62,
      "text": "Oh, is that your liver?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1086.62,
      "end": 1087.62,
      "text": "Well, here's my fist!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1087.62,
      "end": 1089.62,
      "text": "And I pulled it ahead!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1089.62,
      "end": 1091.62,
      "text": "And it wasn't for getting into him!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1091.62,
      "end": 1092.62,
      "text": "Holy shit."
    },
    {
      "start": 1092.62,
      "end": 1094.62,
      "text": "What happened to the monster?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1094.62,
      "end": 1095.62,
      "text": "He's history!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1095.62,
      "end": 1096.62,
      "text": "Action."
    },
    {
      "start": 1096.62,
      "end": 1098.62,
      "text": "And biology!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1098.62,
      "end": 1100.62,
      "text": "And a little metal shop!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1100.62,
      "end": 1102.62,
      "text": "Did you get the formula?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1102.62,
      "end": 1105.09,
      "text": "Oh, no!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1105.09,
      "end": 1107.09,
      "text": "I must have grabbed it too hard!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1107.09,
      "end": 1109.09,
      "text": "It's turned to dust!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1109.09,
      "end": 1111.09,
      "text": "Rinaldo!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1111.09,
      "end": 1112.09,
      "text": "Not to worry!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1112.09,
      "end": 1114.09,
      "text": "I know someone who can help!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1114.09,
      "end": 1116.09,
      "text": "But you're not gonna like it!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1116.09,
      "end": 1118.09,
      "text": "You know me!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1118.09,
      "end": 1119.09,
      "text": "That's right!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1119.09,
      "end": 1123.09,
      "text": "Deranged rocket scientist, Professor Experimental!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1123.09,
      "end": 1125.09,
      "text": "How high do I prefer that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1125.09,
      "end": 1129.09,
      "text": "That whack job got me kicked out of the space program back in 83!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1129.09,
      "end": 1135.09,
      "text": "Well, he's made a lot of scientific-ish advances in formula reproduction."
    },
    {
      "start": 1135.09,
      "end": 1141.09,
      "text": "He could probably recreate Guipsy Button's rainforest formula if you bring him some of this powdery goop!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1141.09,
      "end": 1142.09,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 1142.09,
      "end": 1149.33,
      "text": "So when they say formula, do they mean like a baby formula?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1149.33,
      "end": 1152.33,
      "text": "Uh, it's the rainforest formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 1152.33,
      "end": 1154.33,
      "text": "I've already got what's left of the formula!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1154.33,
      "end": 1157.33,
      "text": "No need to be sticking my glove where it doesn't belong!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1157.33,
      "end": 1170.37,
      "text": "The good professor's secret lab won't be so secret from me after I add it to my GSPDK!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1170.37,
      "end": 1198.09,
      "text": "It's scumbag!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1198.09,
      "end": 1201.09,
      "text": "Put down the science and get up against the wall!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1201.09,
      "end": 1202.09,
      "text": "Hey, hey, hey!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1202.09,
      "end": 1203.09,
      "text": "Come on now!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1203.09,
      "end": 1204.09,
      "text": "Just everybody relax!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1204.09,
      "end": 1205.09,
      "text": "Wow."
    },
    {
      "start": 1205.09,
      "end": 1208.09,
      "text": "We're here for a favor!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1208.09,
      "end": 1209.09,
      "text": "Old school."
    },
    {
      "start": 1209.09,
      "end": 1213.09,
      "text": "Rave switch! Rave switch! Rave switch! Rave switch!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1213.09,
      "end": 1216.09,
      "text": "What the fuck? It's not there?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1216.09,
      "end": 1220.09,
      "text": "It's over. Close the game. We'll play someone else. Grim Fandango?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1222.09,
      "end": 1223.09,
      "text": "Did you get it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1226.09,
      "end": 1228.09,
      "text": "Okay, at least we got this."
    },
    {
      "start": 1228.09,
      "end": 1231.37,
      "text": "Oh, hell yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 1231.37,
      "end": 1233.37,
      "text": "What are we shooting today, boss?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1233.37,
      "end": 1236.9,
      "text": "Oh."
    },
    {
      "start": 1236.9,
      "end": 1238.9,
      "text": "Clowns."
    },
    {
      "start": 1238.9,
      "end": 1239.9,
      "text": "Evil clowns."
    },
    {
      "start": 1239.9,
      "end": 1245.78,
      "text": "This is the insane clown posse video game."
    },
    {
      "start": 1245.78,
      "end": 1247.78,
      "text": "Okay, now we're-"
    },
    {
      "start": 1247.78,
      "end": 1248.78,
      "text": "That's me!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1248.78,
      "end": 1249.78,
      "text": "Oh, those graphics-"
    },
    {
      "start": 1249.78,
      "end": 1251.78,
      "text": "Oh, that is- that is good."
    },
    {
      "start": 1251.78,
      "end": 1252.78,
      "text": "That-"
    },
    {
      "start": 1252.78,
      "end": 1253.78,
      "text": "Ah, crap cycles!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1253.78,
      "end": 1255.78,
      "text": "Dodging!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1255.78,
      "end": 1257.78,
      "text": "Gotcha!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1257.78,
      "end": 1263.21,
      "text": "Graphics are, uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1263.21,
      "end": 1267.13,
      "text": "Invasive maneuvers!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1293.19,
      "end": 1294.19,
      "text": "Good!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1294.19,
      "end": 1295.19,
      "text": "Mayday! Mayday!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1295.19,
      "end": 1297.19,
      "text": "This game kinda blows."
    },
    {
      "start": 1297.19,
      "end": 1302.46,
      "text": "It's a starting edge space simulation game."
    },
    {
      "start": 1302.46,
      "end": 1304.46,
      "text": "I think they weren't simulating space."
    },
    {
      "start": 1304.46,
      "end": 1306.46,
      "text": "They were simulating..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1306.46,
      "end": 1309.46,
      "text": "running people over in space."
    },
    {
      "start": 1309.46,
      "end": 1312.46,
      "text": "That's what happens in spaces, clowns."
    },
    {
      "start": 1312.46,
      "end": 1314.46,
      "text": "It's what you say, clowns."
    },
    {
      "start": 1314.46,
      "end": 1315.46,
      "text": "Fine!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1315.46,
      "end": 1318.46,
      "text": "I didn't want to touch your stupid science any dang way!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1318.46,
      "end": 1327.74,
      "text": "So, you're some kind of expert on formulas now, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1328.74,
      "end": 1333.74,
      "text": "Okay, mister, you can't take a plastic bag full of scorpions into space."
    },
    {
      "start": 1333.74,
      "end": 1338.74,
      "text": "What's it gonna take to get you to recreate this top-secret formula for me?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1339.74,
      "end": 1344.74,
      "text": "Somebody stole a disc of important launch codes for your rocket, and you want me to get him back?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1344.74,
      "end": 1346.74,
      "text": "That sounds fair."
    },
    {
      "start": 1346.74,
      "end": 1349.74,
      "text": "You get me my formula, and I'll find your disc."
    },
    {
      "start": 1349.74,
      "end": 1360.17,
      "text": "What is it? What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1360.17,
      "end": 1362.17,
      "text": "Ronaldo, what is he bubbling about?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1362.17,
      "end": 1367.17,
      "text": "It's ingredients! He's figuring out what he needs to make the formula!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1368.17,
      "end": 1371.17,
      "text": "A bubbly liquid, a flower from the rare..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1371.17,
      "end": 1373.17,
      "text": "We got that ready to die at Karp."
    },
    {
      "start": 1373.17,
      "end": 1374.17,
      "text": "...and some yellow hair?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1374.17,
      "end": 1375.17,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "start": 1375.17,
      "end": 1376.17,
      "text": "We have to try it. Are you ready?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1376.17,
      "end": 1380.17,
      "text": "Looks like we'll be scouring the streets of Brain Blows City tonight."
    },
    {
      "start": 1380.17,
      "end": 1381.17,
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1381.17,
      "end": 1382.17,
      "text": "He's here."
    },
    {
      "start": 1382.17,
      "end": 1387.06,
      "text": "I can't believe Brain Blows City goes to sea."
    },
    {
      "start": 1387.06,
      "end": 1388.06,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 1388.06,
      "end": 1389.06,
      "text": "I'm doing the formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 1389.06,
      "end": 1396.24,
      "text": "I'd better add it now."
    },
    {
      "start": 1396.24,
      "end": 1399.24,
      "text": "They're a very organized pattern of locations this time around."
    },
    {
      "start": 1399.24,
      "end": 1400.24,
      "text": "You gotta be more careful."
    },
    {
      "start": 1400.24,
      "end": 1401.24,
      "text": "Give him the cola as well."
    },
    {
      "start": 1401.24,
      "end": 1404.24,
      "text": "And although these things could have punctured your mallet,"
    },
    {
      "start": 1404.24,
      "end": 1407.24,
      "text": "and you only have two weeks till retirement."
    },
    {
      "start": 1408.24,
      "end": 1412.24,
      "text": "We got used to the dying thing that we're gonna use to cut something."
    },
    {
      "start": 1412.24,
      "end": 1413.24,
      "text": "So easy."
    },
    {
      "start": 1413.24,
      "end": 1415.24,
      "text": "I did not need to know that."
    },
    {
      "start": 1415.24,
      "end": 1417.24,
      "text": "Instead of us having to..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1417.24,
      "end": 1420.24,
      "text": "What was it that we cut the rope with?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1420.24,
      "end": 1422.24,
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1422.24,
      "end": 1424.24,
      "text": "I don't remember."
    },
    {
      "start": 1424.24,
      "end": 1427.24,
      "text": "That game sucked, and I just kinda didn't remember any of it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1427.24,
      "end": 1430.24,
      "text": "Give him the cola. Get that done."
    },
    {
      "start": 1430.24,
      "end": 1434.24,
      "text": "I wonder if that... that vodka you have is also the true..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1434.24,
      "end": 1436.24,
      "text": "Alaparbonated liquid right here."
    },
    {
      "start": 1436.24,
      "end": 1437.24,
      "text": "Man, I'm good."
    },
    {
      "start": 1437.24,
      "end": 1442.24,
      "text": "I know it looks delicious, but it tastes more like one of Ronaldo's old gym socks."
    },
    {
      "start": 1442.24,
      "end": 1449.24,
      "text": "And trust me, you do not want to know how I became familiar with that particular taste sensation."
    },
    {
      "start": 1449.24,
      "end": 1452.24,
      "text": "Okay, you got your bubbly drink."
    },
    {
      "start": 1452.24,
      "end": 1454.24,
      "text": "Now make with the formula, make!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1454.24,
      "end": 1455.24,
      "text": "Ing!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1455.24,
      "end": 1462.78,
      "text": "In beneath flower. Alright."
    },
    {
      "start": 1462.78,
      "end": 1463.78,
      "text": "Bing bong."
    },
    {
      "start": 1463.78,
      "end": 1465.78,
      "text": "Rain blow city."
    },
    {
      "start": 1465.78,
      "end": 1469.78,
      "text": "A town as hard as steel and twice as gray."
    },
    {
      "start": 1469.78,
      "end": 1471.78,
      "text": "She's like a fine lady type."
    },
    {
      "start": 1471.78,
      "end": 1475.78,
      "text": "Treat her right, and she'll make you cupcake shaped like cold ones."
    },
    {
      "start": 1475.78,
      "end": 1476.78,
      "text": "Cold ones."
    },
    {
      "start": 1476.78,
      "end": 1478.78,
      "text": "Treat her wrong, and she'll kick you in the knees."
    },
    {
      "start": 1478.78,
      "end": 1481.78,
      "text": "Official collaboration with cold ones coming on the man game channel."
    },
    {
      "start": 1481.78,
      "end": 1482.78,
      "text": "Gonna have to happen."
    },
    {
      "start": 1482.78,
      "end": 1484.78,
      "text": "Hey guys, where you at? Let's get you on here."
    },
    {
      "start": 1484.78,
      "end": 1486.78,
      "text": "Your woman scares me."
    },
    {
      "start": 1486.78,
      "end": 1489.78,
      "text": "Oh, I gotta go to your country, right? Let me go to your country."
    },
    {
      "start": 1489.78,
      "end": 1490.78,
      "text": "You go on ahead."
    },
    {
      "start": 1490.78,
      "end": 1491.78,
      "text": "Go to Australia."
    },
    {
      "start": 1491.78,
      "end": 1497.78,
      "text": "What do I gotta do? Where do I gotta go? How much money do I gotta spend? Is that shit expensive? Fuck."
    },
    {
      "start": 1497.78,
      "end": 1500.78,
      "text": "You're gonna tell me to spend too much money."
    },
    {
      "start": 1500.78,
      "end": 1504.83,
      "text": "Yeah, you don't want cold ones? You come here."
    },
    {
      "start": 1504.83,
      "end": 1509.83,
      "text": "Yeah. Cold ones coming to my room."
    },
    {
      "start": 1509.83,
      "end": 1514.83,
      "text": "End up going, this place sucks, and then getting hotel rooms on your own dime."
    },
    {
      "start": 1514.83,
      "end": 1519.83,
      "text": "What would you do if MacMuffin kicked down your door right now, as he said that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1526.83,
      "end": 1532.85,
      "text": "Alright. What was the last thing with the blonde hair?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1534.85,
      "end": 1550.62,
      "text": "Do I get any change? Let's not make this personal."
    },
    {
      "start": 1550.62,
      "end": 1560.23,
      "text": "Psst. Code blue. I need some info. I'm not in-row."
    },
    {
      "start": 1561.23,
      "end": 1566.34,
      "text": "It's nonsense, but it's funny nonsense."
    },
    {
      "start": 1588.23,
      "end": 1590.23,
      "text": "There's a fucking badass name."
    },
    {
      "start": 1591.23,
      "end": 1593.23,
      "text": "What cool gadgets?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1594.23,
      "end": 1596.23,
      "text": "Ooh, cool gadgets."
    },
    {
      "start": 1599.23,
      "end": 1605.51,
      "text": "He's gonna drive the car. And by that I mean he's going to pretend to drive the car."
    },
    {
      "start": 1611.03,
      "end": 1614.03,
      "text": "He's weighing me down. I gotta get it back to the professor."
    },
    {
      "start": 1615.03,
      "end": 1616.03,
      "text": "Blonde hair."
    },
    {
      "start": 1618.92,
      "end": 1628.28,
      "text": "I mean, there's gonna be marzipan on the sheet. Last time we thought it would be marzipan and it was the sheet."
    },
    {
      "start": 1628.28,
      "end": 1629.28,
      "text": "Or kinda hair, I guess."
    },
    {
      "start": 1629.28,
      "end": 1637.94,
      "text": "Hold still. You've got a little something right on the side there."
    },
    {
      "start": 1637.94,
      "end": 1641.94,
      "text": "Ow! What are you doing, you animal? Stay away from my hair with those things."
    },
    {
      "start": 1641.94,
      "end": 1645.94,
      "text": "Marzipan? I'm supposed to get some of your hair in this scene."
    },
    {
      "start": 1645.94,
      "end": 1648.94,
      "text": "I told you I won't let you cut my hair for this movie."
    },
    {
      "start": 1648.94,
      "end": 1651.94,
      "text": "Come on! You're ruining the shot!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1651.94,
      "end": 1653.94,
      "text": "I don't care!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1654.94,
      "end": 1655.94,
      "text": "Actresses!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1655.94,
      "end": 1659.47,
      "text": "So now I gotta find the sheet."
    },
    {
      "start": 1659.47,
      "end": 1663.94,
      "text": "Maybe you got a distracter."
    },
    {
      "start": 1664.94,
      "end": 1666.94,
      "text": "Either or. Let's leave our options open."
    },
    {
      "start": 1666.94,
      "end": 1672.1,
      "text": "Find info!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1672.1,
      "end": 1676.1,
      "text": "I'll grind it into a goopy base so I can take it back to some nerdy day."
    },
    {
      "start": 1676.1,
      "end": 1680.08,
      "text": "Must find the sheet."
    },
    {
      "start": 1680.08,
      "end": 1690.21,
      "text": "Must find the sheet."
    },
    {
      "start": 1690.21,
      "end": 1698.23,
      "text": "Not now. It says not now."
    },
    {
      "start": 1698.23,
      "end": 1745.2,
      "text": "Let me check the walkthrough if you want to know what to do."
    },
    {
      "start": 1745.2,
      "end": 1748.2,
      "text": "Hello? Commissioner? Do what to around?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1748.2,
      "end": 1757.37,
      "text": "But tell him. I guess I have a minute to spare and check one of these so-called e-mail."
    },
    {
      "start": 1757.37,
      "end": 1759.37,
      "text": "E-mail."
    }
  ],
  "total_words": 2713,
  "chunked": false
}